    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "the Finest...\nSUPER CONSTELLATIONS\nLITHO. IN U.S. A.",
      "An invitation\nto all discriminating\nair travelers\nfly the luxurious\nSuper\nConstellation",
      "TWA takes pride in its new Super Constellations,\nlatest additions to the Trans World Airlines fleet.\nThey represent our steadfast purpose to achieve the\nvery best in airline service to the public. Referred to\nas the most luxuriously-appointed airplanes in the\nskies, we are sure you will agree that TWA's Super\nConstellations give you a new experience in modern\ntravel - the enjoyment of true luxury living aloft.\nLy TWA\nly the Finest... FLY Mon\nInvitation to a traveler\nA great new airplane with revolutionary new passenger\naccommodations is waiting to carry you to glamorous\ndestinations throughout the world. Whether you are a seasoned\nair traveler, or a first flighter is of no consequence,\nsince sky luxury like this has never been available to\nany air passengers. In the Super Constellation the\nultimate in gracious, spacious comfort has been achieved."
    ],
